{"t":"Coffins","s":"coffins-bfc47","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Sarcophagus_Ectoplasm_c95486.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p>When people die they get buried in so-called <b>Coffins</b>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Coffins\">Coffins</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th><small>Move</small>\n</th>\n<th><small>Walk</small>\n</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:left;\">Notes\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Sarcophagus%20%28Ectoplasm%29\">Sarcophagus (Ectoplasm)</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sarcophagus%20%28Ectoplasm%29\"><img alt=\"Sarcophagus (Ectoplasm)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sarcophagus_Ectoplasm_c95486.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">It's an open Sarcophagus covered in ectoplasm. Perhaps you'll find something useful inside it.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sarcophagus (Open)\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Sarcophagus (Open)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sarcophagus_Open_3a8d0e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">A sarcophagus's purpose is to contain a dead body, like a <a href=\"#/wiki/Coffins\">coffin</a>. The <a href=\"#/wiki/Pharaohs\">pharaohs</a>, being <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">undead</a>, of course refuse to stay in them. Any items placed inside a sarcophagus will be deleted on the next <a href=\"#/wiki/Floor%20Reset\">Floor Reset</a>.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Sarcophagus%20%28Quest%29\">Sarcophagus (Quest)</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sarcophagus%20%28Quest%29\"><img alt=\"Sarcophagus (Quest)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sarcophagus_Quest_b09694.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">A sarcophagus's purpose is to contain a dead body, like a <a href=\"#/wiki/Coffins\">coffin</a>. Perhaps you can find something useful in it.<br/>Unlike the <a href=\"#/wiki/Sarcophagus\">Sarcophagus</a>, this sarcophagus does not open upon using it and does not have a volume.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sarcophagus (Wall)\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Sarcophagus (Wall)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sarcophagus_Wall_9a05ba.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">It is a <a href=\"#/wiki/Sarcophagus\">Sarcophagus</a> standing upright against a wall. Its purpose is to contain a dead body, like a <a href=\"#/wiki/Coffins\">coffin</a>.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Sarcophagus\">Sarcophagus</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sarcophagus\"><img alt=\"Sarcophagus\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sarcophagus_2d97e3.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">A sarcophagus's purpose is to contain a dead body, like a <a href=\"#/wiki/Coffins\">coffin</a>. The <a href=\"#/wiki/Pharaohs\">pharaohs</a>, of course, being <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">undead</a> refuse to stay in them. Any items placed inside a sarcophagus will be deleted on the next <a href=\"#/wiki/Floor%20Reset\">Floor Reset</a>.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stone Coffin (Blue)\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Stone Coffin (Blue)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Stone_Coffin_Blue_0536ec.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">Somebody is buried in it.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Coffin%20%28Quest%29\">Stone Coffin (Quest)</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Coffin%20%28Quest%29\"><img alt=\"Stone Coffin (Quest)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Stone_Coffin_Quest_2d5317.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">Somebody is buried in it. Perhaps you can find something useful in it.<br/>Unlike the <a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Coffin\">Stone Coffin</a>, this coffin does not open upon using it and does not have volume.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stone Coffin (Red)\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Stone Coffin (Red)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Stone_Coffin_Red_87dd63.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">Somebody is buried in it.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stone Coffin (Yellow)\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Stone Coffin (Yellow)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Stone_Coffin_Yellow_d3bdc0.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">Somebody is buried in it.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Coffin\">Stone Coffin</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Coffin\"><img alt=\"Stone Coffin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Stone_Coffin_364750.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">Somebody is buried in it.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Wooden%20Coffin\">Wooden Coffin</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Wooden%20Coffin\"><img alt=\"Wooden Coffin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Wooden_Coffin_fbcc7e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">Somebody is buried in it.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\nSee also other Objects.\n</p></div>","quests":["braindeath-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"braindeath-quest","quest":"Braindeath Quest","step":"1-2","n":8,"title":"Abrir o caixão certo","kind":"mention","coords":[]}]}}